---
title: 'Shortcrust Pastry'
description: 'A basic shortcrust pastry, split out so any tart can reuse it.'
---

## Pastry

[Mix] the @flour{300 g} with the @butter{200 g}(cold, cubed) until sandy.

[Add] the @egg{50 g} and a pinch of @salt{3 g}, then bring together into a ball.

[Rest] wrapped in the refrigerator for ~_{30min}.
